        },
        {
          "text": "Ukubhalwa kozalo lwabo bonke abantwana babo abancane, abafazi babo, namadodana abo, namadodakazi abo, kulo lonke ibandla; ngoba bazingcwelisa esikhundleni sabo esimisiweyo ekungcwelisweni.",
          "type": "text",
