            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi emadodaneni ka-Aroni, abapristi ababesensimini yedlelo lemizi yabo, emzini ngemizi, amadoda ayebizwe ngamagama, ukuze banike isabelo kubo bonke abesilisa phakathi kwabapristi nabo bonke ababekhona. Babalwa phakathi kwamaLevi ngezizukulwane.",
          "type": "text",
